<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 176 0 R
/E (We are also especially proud of the partnerships we have cultivated this year. The Jamii Salama Initiative stands out as a testament to what is possible when organizations come together around a shared goal. What began as an ambitious idea has grown into a powerful collaborative platform, thanks to the commitment and vision of our partners: WiLDAF, FASAT, The Launchpad Digital, C-SEMA, Tai Tanzania, Amani Initiative, and Serengeti Bytes. Each of these partners has carried the initiative with genuine ownership, transforming it into a united force for safer public spaces and community well-being.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 176 0 R
/E (As we close the year, we carry with us the lessons, relationships, and victories of 2024. They remind us that sustainable change is possible when we work together with purpose, courage, and heart. We look ahead to 2025 with renewed determination and an even stronger belief in the power of community-led solutions to end violence and uphold dignity for all.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
