235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (Our Voices Against Harassment \(OVAH\) is a youth and women-led Tanzanian Non-governmental Organization dedicated to ending sexual and gender-based violence \(SGBV\) and promoting gender equality through awareness and advocacy, empowerment, and support)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 177 0 R
/E (In 2015, at just 14 years old, Modesta Joseph launched Our Cries to stand against the physical and sexual harassment she and her fellow students faced on public transport. Determined to create change, she developed a web platform where students could report incidents. The platform collected over a thousand reports, shedding light on the issue. Our Cries installed reporting physical boxes in 20 schools across Dar es Salaam in 2016-17. Partnering with LATRA \(then known as SUMATRA\), Modesta raised awareness on harassment and road safety, mobilizing students, parents, and transport operators to take action. In 2020, Modesta expanded her mission by founding OVAH to combat sexual violence across Tanzania.  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
