<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (Social justice lies at the heart of our mission. We strive for a Tanzania where every individual, regardless of their background, is treated with dignity, respect, and fairness. We work to eliminate systemic barriers and ensure equitable access to opportunities, resources, and basic human rights for all especially girls, women and youths. By advocating for social and economic justice, we aim to create a society where everyone has the opportunity to reach their full potential, free from violence and discrimination.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (At OVAH, we believe that those who benefit from our programs are also the key drivers of their success. We prioritize the active participation of our beneficiaries in the design, implementation, and evaluation of our initiatives. By empowering those we serve to take leadership roles, we ensure that our interventions are both relevant and effective in addressing their unique needs and aspirations.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
