/P 181 0 R
/E (Denis Edga, a 15-year-old student from Urafiki Secondary, initially believed that girls and women who wore short or revealing clothes were provoking violence against themselves. This perspective began to shift after Denis attended weekly Empowering Minds sessions for three months, focused on addressing sexual and gender-based violence \(SGBV\).)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
