/E (Through the Jamii Salama Initiative, OVAH partnered with Launch Pad, an organization specializing in cybercrime and digital safety. Together, we connected Lilian with cyber experts who provided legal guidance and actionable steps to address the harassment. These experts worked tirelessly to safeguard her digital identity and ensure her rights were protected. Due to her intense work schedule it was hard to have a face to face interaction with the psychologist, however Lilian received a series of counseling sessions via phone to help her process the emotional toll of the harassment and rebuild her confidence.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
