/P 187 0 R
/E (From April to July 2024, OVAH implemented the Empowering Minds project in seven secondary schools across Kinondoni and Ubungo municipalities in Dar es Salaam. The project aimed to educate students about recognizing various forms of Sexual and Gender-Based Violence \(SGBV\), provide guidance on reporting incidents, and encourage survivors to seek support. Through interactive workshops, the program also challenged deeply rooted gender and social norms that perpetuate violence, fostering a shift in mindsets and behaviors toward gender equality. By maintaining a participation ratio of 25% male and 75% female, the sessions created an inclusive and supportive environment to actively combat sexual violence.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [0]
>>
