/E (Building on the success of this project, OVAH plans to continue empowering adolescent students by equipping them with the knowledge, skills, and confidence to identify and prevent sexual violence, seek support, and contribute to transforming schools into safe spaces. Through the implementation of long-term strategies, OVAH strives to create environments that actively combat sexual violence and promote gender equality within schools and the broader community)
/Pg 23 0 R
