/E (As part of its commitment to raising awareness and promoting safer public spaces, the Jamii Salama Initiative \(JSI\) has produced a documentary alongside other video advocacy content. The documentary sheds light on the pervasive issue of sexual harassment, the urgent need for initiatives like JSI, and the steps JSI is taking to address this problem. It serves as an advocacy tool to educate the public and inspire action against sexual harassment.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (In addition to the documentary, JSI has developed a series of advocacy videos \(90% of its visual content\) complemented by materials such as posters. These videos cover essential topics, including the prevalence of harassment, the importance of consent, and practical ways to create safe spaces for women and children across Tanzania. Through these efforts, JSI aims to spark dialogue, shift attitudes, and foster accountability in public spaces.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
