/E (This year, OVAH has been at the forefront of providing psychological support to survivors of sexual and gender-based violence, particularly sexual harassment. We have integrated this support into every program we have worked on, from empowering minds, teachers to mentor programs, as well as the Jamii Salama Initiative.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 201 0 R
/E (We have handled six significant cases, including sexual harassment, violence against children, child marriage, domestic abuse, and revenge porn. We have provided guidance, counseling, and legal referrals to over 20 students.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
474 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
