/P 201 0 R
/E (To raise awareness, we have utilized various educational materials such as posters, billboards, banners, flyers, and social media platforms . This allows our followers to see the available spots for counseling sessions. We have also cultivated impactful partnerships with stakeholders such as school teachers from 5 secondary schools who provide guidance and counseling to students , and organizations like Launch Pad Digital, C-sema, and WiLDAF, to strengthen our support network.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
