/P 201 0 R
/E ("I have been facing sexual harassment, including being touched, grabbed, and called inappropriate names, to the point that it affected the way I dressed, my confidence, and my academic performance. The support I received from OVAH through counseling sessions and Empowerment Self-Defense training has boosted my confidence and helped me manage my anxiety and trauma. I feel stronger and freer because now I know what to do when a man approaches me in a way that makes me uncomfortable," says Johnnel Regina, a 19-year-old survivor of sexual harassment.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [5]
>>
