/E (On April 20th, in a collaborative effort with our esteemed partners at Jamii Impact, we orchestrated a meaningful workshop that brought together 40 nursery and primary school owners from Dar es Salaam and Pwani regions. The workshop aimed to empower these educational institutions by addressing critical aspects such as legal frameworks, adherence to governing laws for private schools, creating safe schools against Sexual Gender-Based Violence and access to microloans from Jamii Impact.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [0]
>>
