/E (From July 31 to August 1, the Founder and CEO of OVAH Tanzania modesta joseph, had the opportunity to participate in training organized by THRDC, EAHRI, TCRF, and UDSOL for child rights advocates in Tanzania. These training sessions aimed to enhance the understanding of child rights advocates regarding legal and policy frameworks related to children's rights. The sessions focused on strengthening their ability to engage with national, regional, and international human rights systems related to children. Additionally, the training clarified the roles and limits of human rights defenders \(HRDs\) in promoting and protecting children's rights, identified and addressed challenges faced by child rights a)
